.TH "STYLESHEET.TITLE" "3JS" "September 29, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
StyleSheet.title \- StyleSheet: title property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]title\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property of the
\f[CR]StyleSheet\f[R] interface returns the advisory title of the
current style sheet.
.PP
The title is often specified in the \f[CR]ownerNode\f[R].
